    "created_at": "2023-09-04T11:07:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-04T11:07:45Z",
    "body": "Dialog elements can be open as popovers, but they can't be open via `show()`/`showModal()` and `showPopover()` at the same time. The example code provided, whether `show()` or `showPopover()` is called first, will throw an exception instead of following through.\r\n\r\nI don't think that this can be an issue, so I'm going to close this",
